{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03476",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.35,
      "end_seconds": 7.98,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Oh, uh, hi, doctor, I came as soon as they called me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.3,
      "end_seconds": 12.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.68,
      "end_seconds": 21.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "text": "honestly, it's a swollen calf, and my family pushed me to come"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.47,
      "end_seconds": 26.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.12,
      "end_seconds": 38.54,
      "duration_seconds": 11.42,
      "text": "Just since yesterday. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot. My neighbour said I should get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.48,
      "end_seconds": 44.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.03,
      "end_seconds": 54.49,
      "duration_seconds": 8.46,
      "text": "it's a few times a day. I'd say moderate. My family kept telling me to get it checked"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.04,
      "end_seconds": 57.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.34,
      "end_seconds": 83.28,
      "duration_seconds": 24.94,
      "text": "I mean, when it starts I tend to get a racing heart as well. Oh, and sudden breathlessness five days after surgery. That's been about the same, about three months. The racing heart? That's been since Monday. As for racing heart, mild, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.17,
      "end_seconds": 89.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "let me check a few things. Any fever or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.48,
      "end_seconds": 95.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Oh, no fever or coughing up blood, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.76,
      "end_seconds": 99.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Nothing like wound problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.33,
      "end_seconds": 104.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "no, uh, I haven't had any wound problem"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.4,
      "end_seconds": 108.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.6,
      "end_seconds": 112.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.85,
      "end_seconds": 115.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.91,
      "end_seconds": 120.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "It's tamsulosin, at night for the prostate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.19,
      "end_seconds": 123.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "how much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.92,
      "end_seconds": 129.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "0.4 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.5,
      "end_seconds": 134.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "right, how active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.02,
      "end_seconds": 139.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.93,
      "end_seconds": 142.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.67,
      "end_seconds": 147.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.23,
      "end_seconds": 152.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.28,
      "end_seconds": 156.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.16,
      "end_seconds": 172.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.82,
      "end_seconds": 185.12,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "I've had an enlarged prostate for five years now. I've been putting this off for weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.89,
      "end_seconds": 197.53,
      "duration_seconds": 11.64,
      "text": "right, so an enlarged prostate is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.31,
      "end_seconds": 203.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Right, I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.95,
      "end_seconds": 220.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.46,
      "end_seconds": 238.82,
      "duration_seconds": 16.36,
      "text": "Yes, I had a bunion operation, six years ago. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.49,
      "end_seconds": 245.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.12,
      "end_seconds": 259.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.76,
      "end_seconds": 297.44,
      "duration_seconds": 16.68,
      "text": "okay: weight 86 kilos, height 173 centimetres, BP is 120 over 75, oxygen saturation is 92 percent, heart rate 87, respiratory rate 22, temp 37.5 degrees, BMI works out to 28.7."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.82,
      "end_seconds": 300.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.06,
      "end_seconds": 303.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "okay, we'll go over that shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.64,
      "end_seconds": 309.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.29,
      "end_seconds": 325.2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "sure thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.96,
      "end_seconds": 328.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "look straight ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.1,
      "end_seconds": 349.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "your left calf is swollen and tender and your oxygen is low"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.01,
      "end_seconds": 367.73,
      "duration_seconds": 15.72,
      "text": "good, you can sit up again okay, thinking it through, my working impression is a possible blood clot in the lung after surgery that's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 369.61,
      "end_seconds": 373.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.58,
      "end_seconds": 389.74,
      "duration_seconds": 15.16,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a possible blood clot in the lung after surgery, but I'd like to confirm. Let's book a CT pulmonary angiogram to look into possible pulmonary embolus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 391.45,
      "end_seconds": 393.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Right, um, understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 395.35,
      "end_seconds": 409.15,
      "duration_seconds": 13.8,
      "text": "Let's use enoxaparin, 1.5 mg per kg, once now, single dose. That should help with possible clot. Please go to hospital now, I will call ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 409.64,
      "end_seconds": 415.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Sure. We'll catch up straight away. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 417.14,
      "end_seconds": 420.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "right, I think I understand everything thanks"
    }
  ]
}